pecification \u03c4. The global state Stconsists of all relevant agent states and aggregated contextual information up to stept: at\u223c\u03c0(S t, \u03c4) =P(a|S t, \u03c4)(1) where the policy \u03c0is a function mapping the observable context\u2014such as the current state and task description\u2014to a distribution over candidate agents [ 73,74] (e.g.,via neural scoring, embedding- based models, or Bradley-Terry style approaches [68])."

