- **Citation-Derived Content**: The paragraph includes a summary of prior work on human reasoning strategies (e.g., "In practice, individuals adopt diverse strategies... humans dynamically adapt their strategies..."). This section is explicitly grounded in existing literature (cited as [43,7,27,21]) and serves to justify the authors' design choices. This constitutes the primary citation-derived content.
